WEBVTT

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.320
Kazamatsuri City, huh?

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.110
Feels like I haven't been here in ages.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:15.610
All right, then. Report 
back to HQ in three days.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:17.490
Got it.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.120
Now, then.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.530
"Suzuki Bondo, age 20," eh?

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:02.810
Episode 19
"The Forest of Tragedy"

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:05.720
Glasses won't be enough.

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:08.800
Anyone who knew me will 
instantly figure it out.

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:13.770
<i>I'll control the blood in my face and 
try to change my facial features.</i>

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:16.780
All done.

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:20.780
But this is merely the 
mask he shows the world.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:23.690
His true identity is the legendary spy,

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:26.380
Suzuki Bondo!

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:39.930
Oh, yeah, I forgot to eat.

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:53.720
<i>I will complete my missions.</i>

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:56.330
<i>I refuse to end up like Nagai.</i>

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:05.830
Huh? I feel like I've met this girl before...

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:10.580
Senri Akane
If you spot her walking around alone, 
please contact us. We will reward you.

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:12.960
Wait, this is Akane!

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:18.210
Are you lost, little lady?

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:21.840
Sparkle!

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:22.720
Tch.

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:25.600
What's with the attitude?

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:29.100
You're so quiet. You still can't speak?

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.770
Anyway, I guess I should call.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.290
<i>Hello, this is the House of Ties.</i>

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:41.280
Yeah, uh...

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:43.610
I have Senri Akane-chan with me right now.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:46.250
<i>Oh, my! Thank you so much!</i>

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:48.490
<i>Iko-san... Sure takes me back.</i>

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.120
<i>May I have your name?</i>

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:53.250
I'm Suzuki Bondo!

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:57.900
Thank you for your help today.

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:02.010
Um, Suzuki-san, have we met before?

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:05.480
U-Uh, I'm in show business,

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:07.760
and I've been on TV once.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:10.210
Wow, show business?

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:11.840
I'm just starting out, though.

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:13.740
Oh, right.

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:15.730
You brought Akane-chan here,

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.520
so I need to reward you with cash.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:19.350
No, that's all right.

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:22.080
Running an orphanage 
must take a lot of money.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.280
That's not true at all.

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.720
Wait here. I'll go get it now.

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:28.220
N-No, wait...

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:31.040
<b>Thanks</b>

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:31.040
Please accept it.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.180
Er...

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:36.950
We receive financial aid 
from Martel Group Japan now,

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:38.170
so don't worry about it.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:40.940
Have you heard of Martel Group Japan?

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:44.540
Th-That famous environmental 
protection group?

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:53.130
My!

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:56.680
You really like the famous young man, huh?

00:04:56.680 --> 00:04:57.310
Tch.

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.970
She just clicked her tongue...

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:00.270
She's being shy.

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:03.240
Her face tells a different story.

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:06.420
The kids here are a delicate bunch.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:08.490
A lot of them can't talk.

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:09.870
Her, too?

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:15.030
But that's why we're here. To take care 
of kids who couldn't adapt to society.

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:17.000
Is that so?

00:05:20.740 --> 00:05:22.250
Did you get some good R&R?

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:24.030
Luckily.

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:26.450
So, what's my mission?

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:28.930
You will help in the search for the Key.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:29.640
The Key?

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:35.090
The reason Kazamatsuri 
is so important to Gaia

00:05:35.090 --> 00:05:38.900
is because the Key is 
predicted to appear here.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:42.410
And what exactly is that Key?

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:43.820
A monster.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:46.260
But not just any monster.

00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:51.260
It's an extremely special 
being with immense power.

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:54.810
And what did it do?

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:56.410
The Salvation.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:57.160
Salvation?

00:05:57.510 --> 00:05:59.030
That's the term Gaia uses.

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.570
It refers to the ruin of man.

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:05.670
It's a type of doomsday scenario, 
like the Last Judgment.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:11.300
The Key will drive Gaia's 
fanatics to drastic measures.

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:16.180
That's why the Key must 
be eliminated at all costs.

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:19.310
You guys are taking part, too?

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:21.230
Obviously.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:22.910
And what's with that getup?

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:25.070
For a suit, it sure doesn't suit you.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:27.820
Quit provoking him for no reason.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.060
What?

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:32.200
<i>So neither of them is going 
to bring up Nagai's quitting?</i>

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:30.840
Don't "what" me.

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:32.200
But, y'know...

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.320
Your big mouth is what 
turns people against you.

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:36.530
Team Imamiya, you're all here?

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:37.700
Come.

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:41.710
Now, as for what you rookies will be doing...

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:44.250
I guess you'll be monitoring agents.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:48.220
Pretend to be youngsters gathering 
in town and run surveillance.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:51.850
Um, Tennouji and I are from this city.

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:52.980
Will that be okay?

00:06:52.980 --> 00:06:54.200
It's fine.

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:55.310
Nishikujou.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:58.230
We want you to attend a 
local school during the day.

00:06:58.400 --> 00:06:59.840
A school?

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:00.730
Yay!

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:02.400
Only temporarily.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:04.220
Once our work here is done,

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:05.980
you'll move on to your next assignment.

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:07.160
Got it.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:08.870
You're still not over that?

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:11.360
Hurry up and get used to this life already.

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:13.090
Oh, shut up!

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:14.870
If you make yourself productive,

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:18.150
we might consider arranging a 
high school graduation for you.

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:20.370
What? R-Really?!

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:23.500
Um, I'd really like that!

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:26.540
Then do your job like a pro.

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:28.710
Can I get one, too?

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:29.260
Sure.

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:32.390
<i>I didn't care either way.</i>

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:34.260
<i>I had no good memories of school.</i>

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:36.760
You'll be staking out here,

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:38.740
at one of the entry points to the forest.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:41.050
Monitor the people going in and out.

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:43.020
Do you want us to stop them?

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:45.020
Mostly just observe and report.

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:47.100
That's it?

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:49.030
You're only rookies. Don't get greedy.

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:51.280
Do the jobs you're given.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:53.040
Roger.

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:55.280
Oh, damn it!

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.780
Of all the stupid missions to get...

00:07:57.970 --> 00:08:00.760
Should've seen it coming, with our grades.

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:02.820
You seem to be in a great mood.

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:04.560
Is it because you can go to school?

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:05.290
Problem?

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:06.710
Whatever.

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:09.130
I'll do my job, no matter 
how trashy it might be.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:10.880
I wanna climb the ladder here.

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:19.430
Yo, Mikuni-kun!

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:20.680
Where'd you get assigned?

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:22.380
The scouting team.

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:24.190
That's all I can tell you.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:26.390
Wow, you get to enter the forest.

00:08:26.390 --> 00:08:27.690
"But of course," I guess?

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.190
I didn't say that.

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:31.690
Don't go glory hunting 
and do anything stupid.

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:33.400
Not happening.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:34.900
Not with me.

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:40.550
Wow, that's some confidence right there!

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:49.960
I wish I'd gotten put in 
intelligence or something, too.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:52.380
You'd just be dead weight.

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:54.720
Hey, don't you think we're standing out?

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:56.380
Blame yourselves!

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:58.510
Why are you in a suit and a school uniform

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:00.570
when we're supposed to be street punks?

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:02.490
Follow my lead.

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:05.230
I just got out of school. 
What else could I do?

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:08.130
Well, I get that your girly heart

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:11.350
wants to show off how 
cute you look in uniform.

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:12.480
Do you have a death wish?

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:14.280
T-Try killing me if you can!

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:16.460
Don't underestimate how 
fast I am at running away!

00:09:16.460 --> 00:09:17.490
Wait, you'd run?

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:20.370
<i>Kazamatsuri, Gaia's citadel.</i>

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:23.120
<i>The people here, the businesses 
invited to open up shop here...</i>

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:25.870
<i>Lots of people and entities 
had ties with Gaia.</i>

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:29.630
<i>We were in enemy territory, 
and we had to find Gaia here.</i>

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:31.050
Damn...

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:34.960
Normally, this would be my time 
to shine as a poacher-type.

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:36.200
Really?

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:39.640
Following a target's trail 
is what hunting is all about.

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:42.360
You're way too dumb for 
someone who's serious as shit.

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:44.140
Actually, you're just shit.

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:47.190
And the poacher-type has 
different sub-categories.

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:50.650
There are people who specialize 
in ranged weapons or pursuit.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:52.270
And people who specialize in running away.

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:54.970
Mikuni was a poacher too, wasn't he?

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:57.540
What can you do, by the way?

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.160
Stop my bleeding instantly.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:00.270
What else?

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:02.530
Increase my stamina and stuff.

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:04.620
How is being a good marathon 
runner gonna help?

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.480
You're not very suited to combat.

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:08.680
This is why I hate tainters.

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:12.040
I've heard there are people who can 
produce poison within their body.

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:14.740
That stuff is impossible for me.

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:16.920
Though I am resistant to drugs.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:18.990
You're so lame.

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:21.940
Not like our abilities are any good, either.

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:23.280
This sucks.

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:24.680
I wanna battle, too.

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:28.180
Do you think we could beat 
a monster built for combat?

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:29.940
We'd get wiped out, 100%.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:32.650
I'd run away, so I wouldn't get wiped out.

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:36.320
Even hound-types are faster 
than all of us, so nope.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:38.570
I know, Great Hero.

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:41.200
Never call me a hero again.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:42.920
Wow, aren't you chatty?

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:45.140
What, feeling confident today?

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:47.940
If you start fighting, you'll 
get taken off the mission.

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:49.970
I know that, too.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:53.340
Man, I can't be bothered with anything.

00:10:58.700 --> 00:10:59.470
What's wrong?

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:00.130
Nothing.

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:04.630
Wow!

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:05.540
Here.

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:06.950
Get me one, too!

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:08.530
Just wait a second.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:12.150
Huh? Akane-chan?

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:18.670
Commoners sure have it easy. 
They seem to be having fun.

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.020
You haven't earned the right 
to call people "commoners" yet.

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:25.310
If they'd just let me gain experience, 
I'd be a pro in no time.

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:27.800
Was that...

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:29.660
An emergency signal.

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:32.670
The next team over is being attacked.

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:35.210
Whoa, did something big happen?

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:36.970
Be wary, not excited, idiot!

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.310
Let's go, Nishikujou!

00:11:39.310 --> 00:11:41.280
You do realize you're ignoring orders?

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:43.070
Don't you wanna hog the glory?

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:44.030
No.

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:46.120
We're going to be responsible 
and stick to our mission.

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:49.430
Who knows if we'll get another chance 
to make a name for ourselves?!

00:11:50.930 --> 00:11:52.940
Hey, what are you thinking—

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:56.570
Nobody asked you.

00:11:58.440 --> 00:11:59.900
Let's go, Nishikujou!

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.120
We can't let this slip!

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:01.700
But...

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:05.680
Even if we mess up, we have nothing to lose!

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:07.700
But if we secure the Key...

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:11.230
That's way too risky.

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:12.600
Got it.

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:13.950
You stay here, Tennouji.

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:15.580
You too?!

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:18.280
If we don't climb the ladder, 
we'll remain stifled forever.

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:20.590
We're trusting you to keep watch, Great Hero.

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:23.590
Hey!

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.020
Go after them

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.020
Let them go

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:30.770
Go after them

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:43.050
<i>Crap. I can't find them.</i>

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:49.370
Senri Akane
If you spot her walking around alone,
please contact us. We will reward you.

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:49.370
<i>Akane? Are you kidding me?</i>

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:50.620
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:53.220
<i>I've got a bad feeling about this!</i>

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.130
No good, huh?

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:03.520
Ow...

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:05.600
What the heck?

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:07.890
I-Is this...

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:15.640
What the hell is that thing?

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:18.400
You can't be serious!

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:30.890
Keep fighting, and you'll die someday.

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:33.000
Even geniuses.

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:34.270
Anybody.

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:37.520
Even Mikuni and Esaka-san.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:39.900
And I'm the most likely to die.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:40.900
I need to be the most...

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:43.900
Wait, Akane's here.

00:14:44.120 --> 00:14:46.220
I've gotta save her!

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:48.530
Route A

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:48.530
Route B

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:48.530
Route C

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:48.530
Route D

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:49.360
Route D

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:58.460
Akane...

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:02.670
Found her.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:05.150
She couldn't climb down?

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:06.420
What do I do?

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.090
Call for help

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.090
Climb

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.090
Knock on the trunk

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.090
Call out to her (quietly)

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.090
Throw a pebble at her
and make her notice

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.090
Call out to her (loudly)

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.090
Catch her as she falls

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:08.880
Catch her as she falls

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:10.580
But how?

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:15.690
A monster?

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:17.180
No way!

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:29.030
<i>What now?</i>

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.490
Pattern M

00:15:50.980 --> 00:15:52.130
I did it.

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:00.740
Ow!

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.200
<i>I won!</i>

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:08.560
<i>Good job, me.</i>

00:16:09.060 --> 00:16:10.490
<i>Seriously.</i>

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:14.610
<i>I've gotta do something about Akane first.</i>

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:20.980
Did she hit her head somewhere?

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:23.260
What's that?

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.040
Go

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.040
Don't go

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:28.800
Go

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:33.120
I'll go take a look.

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:35.390
It might be dangerous, so you stay here.

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:43.140
Huh? This seems familiar.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:48.940
Oh, right. It was back then.

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:00.630
You're the Key, aren't you?

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.760
As a member of Guardian,

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:07.710
I have to eliminate her.

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:16.470
Let her go

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:16.470
Capture her

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:16.470
Eliminate her

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:33.990
I understand the situation.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:36.750
Mikuni's corpse is being retrieved.

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:38.710
Everything seems to match your report.

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:40.490
It's a shame.

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:42.440
They summoned a ground dragon?

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:46.000
It seems the Gaia fanatics are 
starting to shed their foolishness.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.070
Gaia's guardian deity...

00:17:48.070 --> 00:17:49.500
Things will get tough.

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:52.000
Uh, may I go now?

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:53.980
Yes, good work.

00:17:53.980 --> 00:17:55.020
You may leave.

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:56.540
Actually, wait.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:57.010
Yes?

00:17:57.320 --> 00:18:02.420
Did you spot anything curious 
near the large monster you saw,

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:07.390
such as an abnormally large number of 
monsters, or an overgrowth of flora?

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:09.220
As I mentioned in my report,

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:11.900
I ran into a scout hound.

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:13.650
Nothing else?

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:14.540
No.

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:15.560
I see.

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:16.440
Dismissed.

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:17.860
Excuse me.

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:23.700
<i>I lied to Guardian about two things.</i>

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:25.450
<i>About Akane,</i>

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:26.700
<i>and about the Key.</i>

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:31.710
<i>I just hope I don't come to 
regret those minor betrayals.</i>

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.460
I really got yelled at.

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:38.110
The instructor slapped me.

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:39.470
And you?

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:40.990
W-Well...

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:43.240
Esaka-san punched me.

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:44.470
That sounds rough, too.

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:47.950
I can't believe you got a kill in.

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:49.670
That's our Great Hero—

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:51.670
Wait, I can't call you that.

00:18:51.670 --> 00:18:53.110
That's our braver!

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:56.000
Something tells me you really suck at English.

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:58.020
Did you run into any monsters?

00:18:58.020 --> 00:19:01.110
We found a scout bird but 
couldn't take it down.

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:04.430
I can't believe Mikunicchi, 
of all people, died.

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:06.570
He was so strong, too.

00:19:06.570 --> 00:19:08.040
What a cruel world.

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:09.350
Here's your order.

00:19:09.350 --> 00:19:10.500
Finally!

00:19:10.740 --> 00:19:14.130
A super-size serving of Genoa-style 
lasagna, with extra basil.

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:19.590
So good!

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:22.270
Weren't you depressed a second ago?

00:19:22.270 --> 00:19:23.470
Oh, yeah.

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:25.880
So was the Key found?

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:26.890
Apparently not.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:30.970
Once the Festa ends, so will this mission.

00:19:51.350 --> 00:19:53.090
<i>Why'd I let the Key go?</i>

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:55.970
<i>Because it appeared in the form of a girl?</i>

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:58.990
<i>I didn't get it myself.</i>

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:01.170
What?

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:03.370
You want to learn how to use a gun?

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:04.440
Yes.

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:05.930
I lack offensive power,

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:08.970
so I think I'd be more useful with a gun.

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:12.440
Besides, I get the feeling 
it'd be a good fit for me.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:15.230
Is something eating at you?

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:18.580
You look like you're seeking 
punishment for yourself.

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:21.440
I... don't know.

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:23.700
Listen, Tennouji.

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:25.950
Superhumans tend to have big egos.

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.450
It's our pride that fuels our powers.

00:20:29.140 --> 00:20:32.050
And someone who's never 
had their pride crushed

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:34.040
can't even handle a single setback.

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:37.520
Nagai lost her powers.

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:38.460
She lost them?

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:42.840
Many superhumans with frail minds 
end up weakening with time.

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:48.220
It goes to show that a superhuman's power 
is linked to their mental condition.

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:50.470
So you can't grow stronger 
if you lack confidence?

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:52.480
Having too much of it is an issue, too.

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:53.770
Just look at Mikuni.

00:20:54.780 --> 00:20:58.070
I've seen loads of people 
who wanted to be heroes.

00:20:58.460 --> 00:21:02.050
And I've seen them all die 
without fighting for the cause.

00:21:02.050 --> 00:21:07.600
My goal is to gain the strength I need.

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:10.080
It's not like I want to be a hero.

00:21:11.610 --> 00:21:14.420
One of our fronts

00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:17.080
is a private security firm.

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:21.450
But if you join it, you'll have 
to put in some real "work."

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:22.560
I don't mind.

00:21:22.560 --> 00:21:27.090
I trained myself in war when I was young.

00:21:27.870 --> 00:21:32.100
Perhaps you need some drastic measures 
in order to break out of your shell, too.

00:21:33.170 --> 00:21:34.920
Should you come back alive,

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:37.100
will you become one of my fine soldiers?

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:38.100
Sure.

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:39.110
Good.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:41.360
Go witness some tragedy.

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:49.620
He didn't drink that?

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:54.620
<i>The life I'd lived until then 
flashed before my eyes.</i>

00:21:55.240 --> 00:21:57.460
<i>An aimless life that had come to a standstill.</i>

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:02.120
<i>I'd kept looking for something 
that would get me out of that rut.</i>

00:22:03.140 --> 00:22:06.520
<i>But I didn't find it in 
the classroom, at home,</i>

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:08.540
<i>in Martel,</i>

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:11.970
<i>or in Guardian.</i>

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:16.830
<i>In the end, my act of betrayal 
in letting the Key go</i>

00:22:17.320 --> 00:22:20.300
<i>was basically what saved me.</i>

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:23.820
<i>So I can't work in Japan anymore.</i>

00:22:23.820 --> 00:22:25.610
<i>I'm running away, out into the world.</i>

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:29.490
<i>And I'm sure...</i>
